  triage:correctionNote "2026-07-22: promote_to_branch corrected from feature/pAI-s17-hermes-chat-identity to feature/pAI-s16-offline-reconciliation. arch-ctm caught scope-boundary conflict: AI.17 (docs/plans/phase-ai/sprint-ai-17-hermes-chat-identity.md) is scoped strictly to the ambient chat-context resolver and states it 'cannot change the Phase AI parser, HTTP API, canonical write path, or post-write router' and 'may run in parallel with AI.11-AI.16 because it does not modify atm-graft, daemon transport, HTTP, storage, or a shared Phase AI contract.' This finding's subject (atm peer sync CLI trigger for reconcile_after_success) is AI.16 deliverable #3 (docs/plans/phase-ai/sprint-ai-16-offline-reconciliation.md). Original mis-target was applied via unverified highest-open-branch heuristic (same mistake pattern as the resolved AI13 scope-mismatch)." .

